OL,3,GNEWSAYork 'chlorinated' tap water fears
OL,4,Aescalated by MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA concern about the quality of tap
OL,7,Fwater in York has been escalated to an
OL,8,Findependent regulator.
OL,10,FLabour MP for York Outer Luke Charters
OL,11,Fhas written a letter to the Drinking
OL,12,FWater Inspectorate (DWI) asking it to
OL,13,Flook into what he called a "chlorinated
OL,14,Ftaste" and odour.
OL,16,FHe said since the summer, residents
OL,17,Fhave continuously complained to him
OL,18,Fabout issue, with some resorting to
OL,19,Fbuying bottled water.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
