OL,3,GNEWSAYork 'chlorinated' tap water fears
OL,4,Aescalated by MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Water said small changes have
OL,7,Fbeen made to the way it treats the
OL,8,Fwater supply network which may have
OL,9,Faffected taste or smell, but insisted
OL,10,Fthe water is safe to drink.
